<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Anwar Alrisala Contracting and General Trading, Ltd. specialises in building projects and full-scope MEP services across Iraq. We deliver turnkey building solutions, residential, commercial and industrial, from design and structural construction to MEP engineering, installation, testing and handover. Using modern MEP practices, our teams ensure energy efficiency, code compliance and long-term operational performance. We also provide technical consultancy and structure foreign investment into building projects, prioritising safety, on-time delivery and measurable value for owners and occupants.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->
